# Boot -> the city -> pause menu, Modes, Arcade: the ordered race "Sunset
# and Vine" (Hollywood) with 7 opponents on the easiest setting, normal
# traffic, rain, at midnight -> its loading and intro. Segments: title and
# map_zoom as in boot-to-roam.pad, then menu (from the city to the race being
# loaded) and race_intro (the race's intro and countdown, until the start).
#
# The menus are driven in real time (they take 30 steps a second of real
# time), so under --mcla_fixed_dt game time runs faster than in a capped run.
# Each wait in the menus also lasts at least as many updates as it would at 60
# FPS (`wait 300ms 18f`): with synchronization validation the menus run at 10
# to 20 FPS, and waits in time alone let their transitions miss presses.
# The pause menu opens right after arriving in the city: some 10 to 20 s of
# game time later the career's phone shows a message, which put the menu
# presses out of step in a timedemo run.
wait 8s
mark title
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
mark menu
wait 1s 60f
press start 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
# Pause -> Modes; Arcade; Ordered race; Sunset and Vine (the first of each).
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
press a 4f
wait 2500ms 150f
press a 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
press a 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
# The race options start at the arcade defaults (the save copy's). A held
# direction repeats after about 8 game updates, so presses last 4 updates
# (one step each, capped or not) and the gaps are real time (the menus move
# 30 times a second of real time).
# Number of opponents 3 -> 7.
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
# Difficulty Medium -> Easy, so the opponents stay in sight for longer.
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press left 4f
wait 300ms 18f
# Down to Weather (past Power ups: Off, Traffic: Normal).
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
# Weather Dynamic -> Clear, Partly cloudy, Cloudy, Rainy.
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
# Time of day Dynamic -> Midnight.
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press right 4f
wait 800ms 48f
# Start race. The game state is 3 (loading) from the arcade map until the race
# is ready, so "roam" holds again when the intro starts.
press a 4f
wait_until roam 120s
mark race_intro
